  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Office of Child Labor, Forced Labor, and Human Trafficking (OCFT) - Preventing and Reducing Child Labor and Forced Labor in Palm Oil Supply Chains</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project works to improve the implementation of social compliance systems that promote acceptable conditions of work and the prevention and reduction of child and forced labor in palm oil supply chains in Colombia and Ecuador. It will also disseminate best practices in social compliance systems in these and other palm oil producing countries, particularly Brazil and Peru.</narrative>
  </description>
